blocks.text:
You order trainers from a German online shop – the parcel arrives without customs forms. {{1}}
After your apprenticeship, you take a job in Austria without needing a special work permit. {{2}}
A graphic designer from Vaduz designs the website of a café in Wien. {{3}}
A dairy supplies its mountain cheese to shops in Italy without customs duties. {{4}}
A saver buys shares in a Norwegian company. {{5}}
After your Matura, you enrol at a university in Innsbruck. {{6}}
A painting company takes on a renovation job in a neighbouring country and sends an invoice for it. {{7}}
A company uses its own money to build a new factory in Portugal. {{8}}
A furniture shop sells its shelves in several EEA countries without paying duties at every border. {{9}}
Your cousin does a paid internship in Berlin. {{10}}
